as usize];\n            }\n            i += 1;\n        }\n    }\n    target\n}\n\npub fn extract(\n    frame: &[u8],\n    startbit: u16,\n    len: u8,\n    signedness: u8,\n    endianness: u8,\n) -> u64 {\n    let mut byte_idx_msb: u16 = 0;\n    let mut byte_idx_lsb: u16 = 0;\n    let mut offset_lsb: u16 = 0;\n    let mut target: u64 = 0;\n    let mut mask: u64 = 0;\n    let mut sign_ext_mask: u64 = 0;\n\n    compute_indexes(\n        startbit,\n        len,\n        endianness,\n        &mut offset_lsb,\n        &mut byte_idx_lsb,\n        &mut byte_idx_msb,\n    );\n\n    target = frame_to_local(frame, byte_idx_lsb, byte_idx_msb, endianness);\n\n    target = target >> offset_lsb;\n\n    mask = (1u64 << len) - 1;\n    target = target & mask;\n\n    if signedness == SIGNED {\n        if ((1u64 << (len - 1)) & target) != 0 {\n            sign_ext_mask = !mask;\n            target = target | sign_ext_mask;\n        }\n    }\n    target\n}\n\npub fn insert(\n    frame: &mut [u8],\n    startbit: u16,\n    len: u8,\n    can_value: u64,\n    endianness: u8,\n) {\n    let mut i: i32 = 0;\n    let mut src: *mut u8 = std::ptr::null_mut();\n    let mut byte_idx_msb: u16 = 0;\n    let mut byte_idx_lsb: u16 = 0;\n    let mut offset_lsb: u16 = 0;\n    let mut target: u64 = 0;\n    let mut mask: u64 = 0;\n    let mut erase_mask: u64 = 0;\n\n    compute_indexes(\n        startbit,\n        len,\n        endianness,\n        &mut offset_lsb,\n        &mut byte_idx_lsb,\n        &mut byte_idx_msb,\n    );\n\n    target = frame_to_local(frame, byte_idx_lsb, byte_idx_msb, endianness);\n\n    mask = (1u64 << len) - 1;\n    erase_mask = !(mask << offset_lsb);\n\n    target = (target & erase_mask) | (can_value << offset_lsb);\n\n    src = &mut target as *mut u64 as *mut u8;\n    if endianness == MOTOROLA {\n        i = byte_idx_lsb as i32;\n        while i >= byte_idx_msb as i32 {\n            unsafe {\n                frame[i as usize] = *src;\n                src = src.add(1);\n      